Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:31.15,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:30.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:36.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
