Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:43.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:44.07,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:43.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:48.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:48.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:56.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:56.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:20:01.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:01.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:09.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:09.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:13.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:17.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:17.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:23.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:23.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:27.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:27.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:30.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:30.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
