Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:36.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:42.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:42.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
